# Schleswig-Holstein Landvolk
# sources: https://www.journals.uchicago.edu/doi/10.2307/2125668 
# https://www.jstor.org/stable/1405576?seq=11 - Landvolk Revolt, centered in Schleswig-Holstein

The German peasantry is beginning to conduct a war against the government. Starting in the state of Schleswig-Holstein, the *Landvolkbewegung* has become increasingly brazen, conducting sabotage.

